[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16921.67, "timestamp": "04:42:01", "text": "锁。等待。那么，我应该制作一把钥匙吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16927.55, "timestamp": "04:42:07", "text": "门钥匙。哦，原来是一扇门。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16933.59, "timestamp": "04:42:13", "text": "好的。先解锁，再上锁。好的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16936.67, "timestamp": "04:42:16", "text": "这个，呃，这个东西。好的。我们需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16939.19, "timestamp": "04:42:19", "text": "让你想要创建一个工具包。这是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16942.35, "timestamp": "04:42:22", "text": "你的队友。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16945.19, "timestamp": "04:42:25", "text": "好的。展示很多东西。我们有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16946.83, "timestamp": "04:42:26", "text": "东西。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16950.99, "timestamp": "04:42:30", "text": "上帝。我们有把枪。我们听到一声“哦，我的天哪！”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16954.628, "timestamp": "04:42:34", "text": "上帝。我太高兴了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16959.39, "timestamp": "04:42:39", "text": "我们从中得到了很多好东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16963.27, "timestamp": "04:42:43", "text": "人。让我把它记下来。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16964.91, "timestamp": "04:42:44", "text": "我们需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16969.35, "timestamp": "04:42:49", "text": "呃，存储。这是什么大型存储空间？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16973.11, "timestamp": "04:42:53", "text": "250 和金属碎片。我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16975.91, "timestamp": "04:42:55", "text": "金属碎片？我认为我们没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16979.23, "timestamp": "04:42:59", "text": "所以，让我们把这二变成一吧。"}]